From: ios-mh2lm
Subject: mh2lm: serialize key and battery SPMI transactions

Use one thread-context controller lock for observer and RW commands.
Serialize transport initialization and diagnose route configuration failures.
Keep fail-closed IRQ behavior and the consumer registry lifecycle.

